        depth = 2,
        instruction = "It's also possible that Storms of Fate, Shadows of the Departed, and/or Apocalypse Nigh lock progress since they leave Prishe unavailable. If you're on one of those and don't get this cutscene, finish them and then resume this guide. You don't have to finish Storms of Fate, just receive the cutscene with Prishe and Ulmia from zoning into Riverne - Site B01 (and perhaps zoning into Monarch Linn).",
